WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.405 --> 00:00:19.056
Whoa! Who are you?

2
00:00:19.057 --> 00:00:23.119
I'm a peregrine falcon.

3
00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:27.816
Peregrine falcons are the fastest animals on earth.

4
00:00:27.817 --> 00:00:30.487
Where do you live?

5
00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:35.139
Peregrine falcons live all over the world.

6
00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:38.592
We like being close to the sea.

7
00:00:38.593 --> 00:00:41.257
What do you eat?

8
00:00:41.258 --> 00:00:46.092
We eat other birds like ducks or pigeons.

9
00:00:46.093 --> 00:00:49.422
We also eat bats.

10
00:00:49.423 --> 00:00:53.007
How do you find prey?

11
00:00:53.008 --> 00:00:57.174
We watch from a high place.

12
00:00:57.175 --> 00:01:02.081
We wait for other birds to fly by.

13
00:01:02.082 --> 00:01:06.339
Is it hard to see from up high?

14
00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:11.976
Nope! Our eyes are amazing.

15
00:01:11.977 --> 00:01:17.711
We can spot small animals from far away.

16
00:01:17.712 --> 00:01:22.089
Is that when you fly fast?

17
00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:27.489
Yes! We dive down toward our prey.

18
00:01:27.490 --> 00:01:32.594
We catch it in midair.

19
00:01:32.595 --> 00:01:36.127
Do you have any enemies?

20
00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:40.739
Eagles and owls sometimes try to eat us.

21
00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:46.183
But we don't have many enemies.

22
00:01:46.184 --> 00:01:49.799
Oh! I see a flock of pigeons!

23
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:52.912
Time to hunt!

24
00:01:52.913 --> 00:02:00.129
Good-bye, Peregrine Falcon!
